      <Id>PL-E02</Id>
      <ShortTitle>Attack path from the business network via {source.Name} to {target.Name}</ShortTitle>
      <Category>E</Category>
      <Description>{source.Name} is on the business network, which is far more exposed to phishing and ransomware. This flow is a path from a compromised office PC or server into the plant.</Description>
      <PropertiesMetaData>
