      <Id>PL-D01</Id>
      <ShortTitle>Carrier or WAN outage cuts {source.Name} from {target.Name}</ShortTitle>
      <Category>D</Category>
      <Description>The link between {source.Name} and {target.Name} depends on an external carrier or WAN. An outage, a jamming attack or an attack on the provider stops remote control and monitoring.</Description>
