      <Id>PL-E04</Id>
      <ShortTitle>Unmanaged or undocumented WAN or cellular connection at {target.Name}</ShortTitle>
      <Category>E</Category>
      <Description>Cellular routers and WAN links are often installed by vendors or contractors and not managed by the site. They can bypass the firewall and give a direct way into the zone.</Description>
      <PropertiesMetaData>
