      <ShortTitle>{target.Name} cannot be restored quickly after ransomware or failure</ShortTitle>
      <Category>D</Category>
      <Description>No tested backup exists for {target.Name}, or the restore has never been tried. After ransomware, a wiper or a hardware failure the plant may run without it for days or weeks.</Description>
