          <Name>PossibleMitigations</Name>
          <Label>Recommended Countermeasure(s)</Label>
          <HideFromUI>false</HideFromUI>
          <Values>
            <Value>Run a cyber-HAZOP or consequence analysis for this controller. Confirm that the worst cases are covered by safeguards an attacker cannot change remotely (mechanical relief, hard-wired trips, independent SIS). Record the scenario reference.</Value>
          </Values>
          <Description>Typical asset-owner countermeasures for this threat.</Description>
          <Id>PossibleMitigations</Id>
