      <Id>PL-S05</Id>
      <ShortTitle>{source.Name} tricked into giving access to {target.Name}</ShortTitle>
      <Category>S</Category>
      <Description>{source.Name} may not recognise phishing, social engineering or pretext phone calls. A single successful lure can give an attacker valid access to {target.Name}.</Description>
      <PropertiesMetaData>
